  "description": "Woo-Jung was a child star who had to give up his dreams because of some malicious rumors. Carrying that trauma with him, he’s now just a normal high school student. When some bullies confront Woo-Jung on the first day of school, a majestic figure, like a hero from a video game, magically comes to Woo-Jung’s rescue... \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes an epilogue and seven side story chapters. The side stories are rated R19.*",
